"Punta de la Luna is a hillside seaside neighborhood on the western point of Apex's crescent."
"Its single narrow brick lane is closed to outside cars and lit by fake gas lamps."
"Trellises and nooks hide its bicycle racks; a stairway descends past tile-roofed cottages."
"A painted iron archway welcomes visitors at the foot of the stairs to the boardwalk."
"The wide, windy boardwalk has a rope fence and binoculars aimed south at F City and the Span."
"The boardwalk has shops, a food truck lot and the only bed and breakfast Alden saw on Anesidora."
"The Artonan Ambassador's residence sits in Punta de la Luna."
"A train station lies north of the neighborhood."
"It is an evacuation area in emergencies, and was emptied the night of the Matadero attack."
"Ocean surrounds it on three sides, and its houses have big yards."
"In the flood it was abandoned 'to the fish', and part of the crescent's western tip washed away."
"A Morph actor who plays every role in 'Love Across Dimensions' lives there."
"After the flood, its boardwalk, cottages and the ambassador's mansion were gone."
"The hill where the residence stood was cleared and made ready for new construction."
